  "notes": [
    "Target is the GLPOracle; its reset is the comptroller's switch to the PriceOracleProxyETH that routes lplvGLP to it. The previous oracle used identical logic since Nov 2022, but rule 7 counts the pointer change.",
    "plvGLP borrowed out of lplvGLP is valued at its pre-donation redemption value (exchange rate x GLP price); MIM is unpriced and valued at the USDC the attacker realised.",
    "Later DPX and MAGIC borrows by other accounts in the same blocks used ordinary collateral (no lplvGLP position) and are not counted."
